# 💻 My First C Codes (C Programming Fundamentals)

A collection of foundational **C programming** codes, basic algorithms, mathematical calculations, and university assignments written during my early practice with the C language.

---

## 📂 Included Scripts & Algorithms

This repository contains basic C scripts focusing on logic building, control structures, and mathematical applications:

### 📐 Geometry & Mathematics
* **`Daire alanı hesaplama.cpp`** – Circle area calculation.
* **`Dikdörtgenin iç açıları toplamı.cpp`** – Interior angles sum of a rectangle.
* **`Üçgenin iç açıları toplami.cpp`** – Interior angles sum of a triangle.
* **`EBOB.cpp` & `EKOK.cpp`** – Greatest Common Divisor (GCD) and Least Common Multiple (LCM) calculations.
* **`Asal sayı kodu.cpp`** – Prime number check algorithm.

### 🔢 Logic & Conditional Operations
* **`3'lü swith case mantığı(NOTHESAPLAMASİS).cpp`** – Grade calculation system using nested `switch-case` statements.
* **`vki hesaplama kodu.cpp`** – Body Mass Index (BMI) calculator.
* **`en büyük sayıyı bulma.cpp`** – Finding the maximum number among inputs.
* **`sıralama kodu(if,else,if else).cpp`** – Number sorting using conditional logic (`if`, `else if`, `else`).

### 🔄 Loops & Patterns
* **`Yıldızlarddan üçgen oluşturma.cpp`** – Pattern printing (triangle using asterisks) with nested loops.
* **`toplamayı bitirmek için 0 gir.cpp`** – Sentinel-controlled loop (accumulating numbers until 0 is entered).

### 📝 Assignments & Practice
* **`Odev.cpp`**, **`Odev2.cpp`**, **`Odev3.cpp`** – Practical C assignments demonstrating foundational problem-solving techniques.

